<%- include('partials/header') %><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR JOURNEY STARTS HERE</span><h1>Find your next<br><em>Bangladesh</em> adventure.</h1><p>From misty hills to golden beaches, discover remarkable places, plan smarter trips and travel with confidence.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="/destinations">Explore destinations <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/planner">Build my trip →</a></div><div class="hero-proof"><div class="avatar-stack"><span>☀</span><span>✦</span><span>⌁</span></div><span>Made for curious travellers<br><b>Discover more, stress less.</b></span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="sun"></div><div class="hill hill-back"></div><div class="hill hill-front"></div><div class="river"></div><div class="hero-stamp"><span>বাংলাদেশ</span><b>Beautiful<br>by nature.</b><small>Explore the extraordinary</small></div><div class="floating-note"><span class="note-icon">⌖</span><span><b>64 districts</b><small>Countless stories</small></span></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">GO SOMEWHERE NEW</span><h2>Places worth the journey</h2><p>Find the landscape that speaks to you.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/destinations">All destinations ↗</a></div><div class="destination-grid"><% if(destinations.length){ destinations.forEach((d,i)=>{ %><a class="destination-card" href="/destinations/<%= d.id %>"><div class="destination-image scene scene-<%= i%4 %>"><span class="scene-symbol"><%= ['⌁','☼','♧','◈'][i%4] %></span><span class="image-tag"><%= d.division||'Bangladesh' %></span></div><div class="destination-info"><div><h3><%= d.name %></h3><p><%= d.district||d.division||'Bangladesh' %></p></div><span class="round-arrow">↗</span></div><% if(d.description){ %><p class="card-desc"><%= d.description.slice(0,105) %><%= d.description.length>105?'…':'' %></p><% } %></a><% }) } else { %><div class="empty-state"><h3>Your next adventure starts here</h3><p>Add destinations from the admin panel to publish them here.</p></div><% } %></div></section><section class="planner-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR TRIP, YOUR WAY</span><h2>Big dreams. Clear budgets.</h2><p>Build a travel plan around your dates, group size and budget with our quick trip estimator.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/planner">Plan your trip <span>→</span></a></div><div class="banner-art"><div class="ticket"><small>TRAVEL NOTE</small><b>Take the<br>scenic route.</b><span>BD · 001</span></div><div class="banner-circle">✦</div></div></section><section class="section package-section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">TRAVEL MADE SIMPLE</span><h2>Curated tour packages</h2><p>Thoughtful trips for your kind of traveller.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/packages">Browse packages ↗</a></div><div class="package-grid"><% if(packages.length){ packages.forEach(p=>{ %><article class="package-card"><div class="package-icon">✧</div><span class="pill"><%= p.duration_days %> days</span><h3><%= p.title %></h3><p><%= p.destination_name %></p><div class="package-bottom"><strong>৳ <%= money(p.package_price_bdt) %></strong><a href="/packages/<%= p.id %>">View details ↗</a></div></article><% }) } else { %><div class="empty-state"><p>Tour packages will appear here when published by an administrator.</p></div><% } %></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
